1
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,600
Tomorrow's a day off.

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,200
You have to keep me company.

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:09,360
Hello, Mom.

4
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:10,880
I have something to take care of at the college.

5
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:12,840
I won't be able to come home for a few days.

6
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:14,440
Usually, Ing doesn't take anyone under his wing.

7
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:16,320
That means you must be pretty special.

8
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:18,800
Don't tell your friends about us again.

9
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:20,720
You're acting all disgusted.

10
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:22,120
Do I look that disgusting?

11
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:23,000
P'Ing,

12
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:25,440
do we have to talk about it now?

13
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:26,400
Someone might see us.

14
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:28,280
I'm a straightforward guy.

15
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:29,280
And let me tell you this,

16
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:30,480
it won't be long before I make you

17
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:31,800
want to be mine.

18
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:37,520
So,

19
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:40,759
whatever it is, just say it.

20
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:51,000
You know that we can't go public,

21
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,520
but you did that today

22
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:54,400
while P'Phet and Itt were right there.

23
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:58,960
Thought it was something serious.

24
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:01,080
Is that all it is?

25
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:05,240
Why?

26
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:07,080
Are you scared?

27
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,320
If people find out,

28
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:11,840
it won't be a laughing matter.

29
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:14,840
Can you stop talking and acting so recklessly?

30
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:17,040
But I've already done it, haven't I?

31
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:18,840
And I can't turn back time.

32
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:20,960
Yok, it's a holiday today.

33
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,320
Shouldn't we be happy

34
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,920
instead of standing here fighting?

35
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,440
And all over such a trivial little thing.

36
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:32,680
I don't think this is trivial.

37
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:34,240
But it's not a big deal, either.

38
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:39,880
Yok.

39
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:41,320
Yok.

40
00:02:42,880 --> 00:02:43,480
Hey.

41
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:44,960
What is it?

42
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:47,640
Do I have to beg for your forgiveness

43
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:48,960
for us to talk nicely?

44
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:52,880
Have you ever thought about me?

45
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:55,480
My life doesn't just belong to me.

46
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:57,320
You can do whatever you want,

47
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,760
but I can't.

48
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:02,280
You don't know anything

49
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:04,880
about us or my training.

50
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:13,200
Yok.

51
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:21,079
I'm sorry.

52
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,400
I'm sorry. I didn't realize...

53
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:26,680
how much pressure you're under.

54
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,480
I won't do this ever again.

55
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,480
Okay?

56
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:36,520
Just calm down. Please.

57
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:38,640
Come here.

58
00:03:39,079 --> 00:03:39,640
Look.

59
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:41,360
Aren't you hot?

60
00:03:41,600 --> 00:03:42,560
Let me take your jacket off.

61
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:43,240
I'm fine.

62
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:44,600
Yok.

63
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:48,160
Do you think I'm just being irrational?

64
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:54,040
You could always find an excuse.

65
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,560
But at the end of the day,

66
00:03:57,760 --> 00:03:59,240
you always win.

67
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,600
It's your fault for being so cute

68
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:04,120
and making me such a sucker for you.

69
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:05,600
You know that, don't you?

70
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:08,880
Look.

71
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:13,160
We haven't seen each other for days.

72
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:17,120
Don't you miss me at all?

73
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,839
I've been missing you so badly.

74
00:04:24,960 --> 00:04:26,200
I'm sorry.

75
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:28,120
I took the teasing too far today.

76
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:28,920
But do you know why?

77
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:30,040
It's because I missed you.

78
00:04:30,080 --> 00:04:32,600
We haven't talked to or seen each other in days.

79
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:34,159
I missed you.

80
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:49,720
I have to go now.

81
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:50,840
Wait.

82
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:53,960
Do you really have to go?

83
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:00,720
Yok.

84
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,920
I'm hungry. Make me something.

85
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:05,720
Just order something.

86
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:07,080
I have to go.

87
00:05:09,880 --> 00:05:10,800
Yok.

88
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:25,680
Why?

89
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:33,840
You weren't like this before, Yok.

90
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:35,120
What did I do wrong

91
00:05:35,159 --> 00:05:36,360
to make you change so much?

92
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:41,400
Can't you just make me this one meal?

93
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:14,840
I'm leaving.

94
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:28,200
Why are you being so cold?

95
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:32,640
You're being so freaking cold.

96
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,280
Let's just end things here.

97
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:03,480
Yok.

98
00:07:15,840 --> 00:07:17,160
You have no right to say that.

99
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:31,240
♪ I left my deepest scars upon your heart ♪

100
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:36,840
♪ Turned your bright world into darken dark ♪

101
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:41,600
♪ Now it's breaking me apart ♪

102
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:49,080
♪ It's my fault for every broken part we had ♪

103
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:57,040
♪ Time slipping, we're not getting younger ♪

104
00:07:57,080 --> 00:08:02,480
♪ We tried our best, yet I destroy the glow ♪

105
00:08:02,520 --> 00:08:06,800
♪ I made it harder to hold on ♪

106
00:08:07,280 --> 00:08:12,200
♪ All the regret keeps going on and on ♪

107
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:17,560
♪ I know what I have done wrong ♪

108
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:23,240
♪ Why did I push you away? ♪

109
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:33,240
♪ It's too late to save us now ♪

110
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:38,640
♪ I hate that I hurt you this way ♪

111
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:43,919
♪ The pain gets heavier every day ♪

112
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:49,440
♪ I'm losing you ♪

113
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:52,800
♪ Again and again ♪

114
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:58,480
♪ I know what I have done wrong ♪

115
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:19,520
Is it too tight?

116
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:23,880
Maybe sometimes,

117
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:25,160
you're just making things

118
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,560
more complicated than they need to be.

119
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:31,960
If you ever need to let it all out,

120
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:35,040
I'm right here for you.

121
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:44,640
Let's just end things here.

122
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,520
You have no right to say that.

123
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:05,720
Yes, Dad?

124
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:06,920
Where are you?

125
00:12:08,800 --> 00:12:10,560
-Well... -No matter where you are,

126
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:11,920
get home right now.

127
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:51,360
[My Capy]

128
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:52,360
[You have no right.]

129
00:12:52,400 --> 00:12:53,080
[You're cruel and selfish.]

130
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:53,760
[Did you just see me]

131
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:55,000
[as someone to sleep with?]

132
00:12:58,800 --> 00:13:00,400
This will be...

133
00:13:00,400 --> 00:13:02,840
the first building you'll oversee for this project.

134
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:07,920
Aren't you going to set foot

135
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:09,760
on the site you'll be managing?

136
00:13:18,560 --> 00:13:20,240
สูบบุหรี่มันไม่ดีนะครับ

137
00:13:34,360 --> 00:13:36,960
I'd really like to thank you, Mr. Jomphol

138
00:13:37,400 --> 00:13:39,720
and Jane, for honoring us

139
00:13:40,040 --> 00:13:41,680
by joining my family

140
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:43,440
for this meal today.

141
00:13:43,480 --> 00:13:44,840
The pleasure is all mine.

142
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:46,800
This is wonderful.

143
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:47,920
You're very welcome.

144
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:48,880
Thank you so much.

145
00:13:48,880 --> 00:13:49,560
[Just finished eating at Grandpa's.]

146
00:13:49,560 --> 00:13:50,200
[He's being much nicer to me.]

147
00:13:50,520 --> 00:13:52,920
Jane, do you enjoy playing any sports?

148
00:13:53,560 --> 00:13:55,720
[Happy for you.]

149
00:13:56,160 --> 00:13:58,520
Yok is actually quite talented in many areas.

150
00:13:58,560 --> 00:14:00,960
He's good at boxing, basketball...

151
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:03,240
Maybe it'd be nice if you could go golfing together

152
00:14:03,280 --> 00:14:04,080
sometime.

153
00:14:05,280 --> 00:14:06,760
I prefer going with my friends.

154
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:13,200
[Grandpa was praising you, too.]

155
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:15,040
-[Said he's very impressed with you.]    -[Really?]

156
00:14:16,680 --> 00:14:18,200
Are you done with your phone yet?

157
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:19,840
Are you talking to me, too?

158
00:14:22,160 --> 00:14:23,040
Not at all, dear.

159
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:24,800
You're our guest. Please make yourself at home.

160
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:29,160
Jane...

161
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:31,280
Right.

162
00:14:31,760 --> 00:14:33,520
I heard from your dad

163
00:14:33,560 --> 00:14:35,960
that you're studying and interning at the same time.

164
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:36,560
That's right.

165
00:14:36,800 --> 00:14:38,160
I'm interning at Araya Group.

166
00:14:39,280 --> 00:14:40,720
Araya Group?

167
00:14:41,680 --> 00:14:44,160
Tiwakorn Adularaya

168
00:14:44,160 --> 00:14:46,160
or Ing, CEO of Araya Group,

169
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:49,120
is one of the most brilliant people I've ever met.

170
00:14:49,160 --> 00:14:50,080
Indeed.

171
00:14:50,120 --> 00:14:51,920
He's taught me a great deal.

172
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:58,600
That's good to hear.

173
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:01,440
Maybe I should have Jane

174
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:03,320
intern there as well.

175
00:15:04,800 --> 00:15:06,040
Enough, Dad.

176
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:08,400
Isn't this already awkward enough?

177
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:11,160
If all I have to do is have a meal with them

178
00:15:11,280 --> 00:15:13,840
for your sake, that's fine.

179
00:15:14,400 --> 00:15:16,840
But setting me up with him?

180
00:15:17,280 --> 00:15:18,440
That's where I draw the line.

181
00:15:24,040 --> 00:15:25,200
Jane,

182
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:26,680
do it for my sake.

183
00:15:40,520 --> 00:15:41,520
Thank you.

184
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:44,480
If that's all, I'll take my leave now.

185
00:15:45,160 --> 00:15:46,120
Wait.

186
00:15:51,800 --> 00:15:55,040
Was that how I taught you to treat guests?

187
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:58,120
Honey, don't be so hard on him.

188
00:15:58,240 --> 00:15:59,720
Didn't you see how Jane was acting?

189
00:16:04,440 --> 00:16:05,160
Here we go again.

190
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:09,040
Mr. Jomphol's daughter

191
00:16:09,040 --> 00:16:10,560
only went abroad once,

192
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:12,560
and she came back a completely different person.

193
00:16:13,760 --> 00:16:15,240
If I'd known this would happen,

194
00:16:15,280 --> 00:16:17,520
I never would've let you send Yok abroad.

195
00:16:18,760 --> 00:16:19,840
That's enough.

196
00:16:20,720 --> 00:16:21,800
What did you just say?

197
00:16:22,680 --> 00:16:24,160
I said that's enough.

198
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:26,400
Both of you saw and heard everything.

199
00:16:26,720 --> 00:16:28,080
Do you still not get

200
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:30,160
just how much Jane wants nothing to do with us?

201
00:16:34,280 --> 00:16:34,920
There you go.

202
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:36,720
Your precious son.

203
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:39,120
He's your son, too.

204
00:16:39,160 --> 00:16:40,360
We made him together.

205
00:16:58,720 --> 00:17:00,240
You called for me, Mr. Ing?

206
00:17:00,760 --> 00:17:01,520
Oh.

207
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:04,720
I wanted to ask about Yok's internship.

208
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:06,359
He hasn't shown up in days.

209
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:07,200
He's completely disappeared.

210
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,000
I see.

211
00:17:10,560 --> 00:17:12,839
It might be due to the overlapping holidays.

212
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:14,960
There might've been some changes.

213
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:16,720
I'll check on it right away.

214
00:17:19,079 --> 00:17:20,119
Now get back to work.

215
00:17:30,560 --> 00:17:31,160
What's up?

216
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:32,240
Hey, Ing.

217
00:17:32,240 --> 00:17:33,800
Let's go for drinks at Zen's place tonight.

218
00:17:33,840 --> 00:17:36,040
It's just me, Vince, and a few friends.

219
00:17:36,080 --> 00:17:36,720
Count me in.

220
00:17:37,320 --> 00:17:38,360
I was getting bored anyway.

221
00:17:38,760 --> 00:17:41,200
Oh, please. A busy guy like you...

222
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:42,240
actually has free time?

223
00:17:42,280 --> 00:17:43,200
Tell you what.

224
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:45,600
No heading home until you're wasted tonight, okay?

225
00:17:47,040 --> 00:17:48,080
Yeah. See you.

226
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:50,040
Yeah, see you.

227
00:18:03,400 --> 00:18:04,200
Hey,

228
00:18:05,200 --> 00:18:06,560
you don't look like you're having fun.

229
00:18:06,840 --> 00:18:07,760
Is something up?

230
00:18:08,520 --> 00:18:09,560
I'm just tired.

231
00:18:14,520 --> 00:18:15,440
Hey, Vince.

232
00:18:15,600 --> 00:18:16,440
Come here for a sec.

233
00:18:18,600 --> 00:18:20,920
Can you find a few guys

234
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:22,640
to entertain Mr. Ing here?

235
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:23,680
Well,

236
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:25,320
I actually have someone in mind.

237
00:18:26,280 --> 00:18:28,400
Ing, remember Junior?

238
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:29,800
Junior?

239
00:18:31,120 --> 00:18:31,880
Who's that?

240
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:35,640
The one you met at my barber shop.

241
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:36,520
Oh.

242
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:38,960
He's a bit short on cash right now.

243
00:18:39,560 --> 00:18:41,800
He's looking for a benefactor. Interested?

244
00:18:45,320 --> 00:18:45,960
Okay.

245
00:18:46,840 --> 00:18:47,720
Call him over.

246
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:48,800
I thought...

247
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:51,200
you were into guys like Pipi.

248
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:52,560
Have you changed your type

249
00:18:52,600 --> 00:18:54,560
to innocent virgins now?

250
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:58,480
Being a virgin doesn't always mean being innocent.

251
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:00,880
As for Junior,

252
00:19:01,560 --> 00:19:02,520
just call him.

253
00:19:03,080 --> 00:19:04,480
Same place, same price.

254
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:06,200
Make it tonight.

255
00:19:07,160 --> 00:19:07,800
Deal.

256
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:15,200
-Cheers. -Stop stressing and drink up, then.

257
00:19:28,080 --> 00:19:28,800
Whoa...

258
00:19:42,800 --> 00:19:43,680
Sit here.

259
00:19:50,600 --> 00:19:51,320
Come on.

260
00:19:54,040 --> 00:19:55,200
I'm sorry, Mr. Ing.

261
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:04,800
To be honest,

262
00:20:05,280 --> 00:20:06,320
you...

263
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:08,120
are not cut out for this job.

264
00:20:11,360 --> 00:20:12,600
People in this industry

265
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:13,840
will just take advantage of you.

266
00:20:17,320 --> 00:20:18,120
How about this?

267
00:20:20,280 --> 00:20:21,120
I'll take care of you.

268
00:20:26,680 --> 00:20:27,640
Really?

269
00:20:29,080 --> 00:20:30,440
With a guy like me,

270
00:20:31,400 --> 00:20:32,760
I mean what I say.

271
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:41,760
Here.

272
00:20:42,680 --> 00:20:43,920
Quit this job.

273
00:20:48,560 --> 00:20:50,000
Use this card for whatever you need.

274
00:21:01,440 --> 00:21:02,760
You've got a good face.

275
00:21:04,440 --> 00:21:06,000
Stop staring at the floor, okay?

276
00:21:06,160 --> 00:21:07,040
Have some confidence.

277
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:10,720
See you around, Junior.

278
00:21:25,360 --> 00:21:26,160
Come in.

279
00:21:36,440 --> 00:21:38,240
Do you think you're some kind of god?

280
00:21:38,960 --> 00:21:40,080
Do I need to summon you

281
00:21:40,120 --> 00:21:41,320
just to get you here?

282
00:21:55,880 --> 00:21:57,240
Dressed like that...

283
00:21:57,520 --> 00:21:58,680
Going to boxing practice after this?

284
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:03,080
Sorry to break it to you.

285
00:22:03,960 --> 00:22:05,800
I'm afraid you won't be going anywhere.

286
00:22:06,760 --> 00:22:07,720
Excuse me?

287
00:22:09,680 --> 00:22:12,080
Today is the day I settle the score with you.

288
00:22:16,920 --> 00:22:18,320
Who do you think you are

289
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:20,480
to dump me just like that?

290
00:22:22,720 --> 00:22:23,720
P'Ing,

291
00:22:24,080 --> 00:22:25,400
we're not a good fit for each other.

292
00:22:25,840 --> 00:22:27,120
We'll only have more problems.

293
00:22:27,320 --> 00:22:28,920
Oh, we're not a good fit?

294
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:30,680
You've been inside me for half a year,

295
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:31,840
and now you're saying that?

296
00:22:32,520 --> 00:22:33,880
The bottom's at a disadvantage,

297
00:22:33,920 --> 00:22:34,520
you jerk.

298
00:22:38,520 --> 00:22:40,040
What exactly do you want?

299
00:22:43,040 --> 00:22:45,240
Oh, it's simple.

300
00:22:46,320 --> 00:22:47,440
Just take off your pants

301
00:22:47,480 --> 00:22:49,040
and lie face down so I can do my thing.

302
00:22:51,040 --> 00:22:51,840
No.

303
00:22:55,840 --> 00:22:56,600
Get over here.

304
00:23:02,320 --> 00:23:03,080
Come here.

305
00:23:03,840 --> 00:23:04,920
Listen to me.

306
00:23:05,360 --> 00:23:07,080
If I don't get to be inside you in this life,

307
00:23:07,120 --> 00:23:08,240
don't ever call me Ing again.

308
00:23:08,880 --> 00:23:09,960
I'm not letting you...

309
00:23:14,200 --> 00:23:15,560
Told you. Just give up.

310
00:23:15,600 --> 00:23:16,160
Come on.

311
00:23:19,320 --> 00:23:21,720
Fine. Get over here.

312
00:23:25,320 --> 00:23:26,920
Just be my bottom.

313
00:23:29,720 --> 00:23:30,520
Come here.

314
00:23:34,240 --> 00:23:36,160
Is ruining my life the only way

315
00:23:36,160 --> 00:23:37,080
you'll be satisfied?

316
00:23:37,080 --> 00:23:37,880
Yeah.

317
00:23:38,160 --> 00:23:39,640
If you've got the guts, just break my arm.

318
00:23:40,600 --> 00:23:41,200
[Coach Khun]

319
00:23:41,240 --> 00:23:42,160
Damn it, Yok.

320
00:23:42,160 --> 00:23:44,040
You said you'd leave me alone.

321
00:23:44,080 --> 00:23:45,320
[Coach Khun]

322
00:23:45,320 --> 00:23:47,640
My arm's about to break. Damn it.

323
00:23:56,240 --> 00:23:57,320
What's wrong with the door?

324
00:24:02,320 --> 00:24:03,040
Oh...

325
00:24:03,440 --> 00:24:04,640
Looks like the lock broke

326
00:24:04,680 --> 00:24:05,640
from that impact just now.

327
00:24:05,680 --> 00:24:06,680
[Coach Khun]

328
00:24:06,720 --> 00:24:09,200
[Missed call from Coach Khun]

329
00:24:09,520 --> 00:24:11,240
You did this yourself. It's not my fault.

330
00:24:12,240 --> 00:24:13,240
Actually, that works for me.

331
00:24:14,120 --> 00:24:16,320
That way, you'll have to stay with me even longer.

332
00:24:18,840 --> 00:24:20,040
I can't stay.

333
00:24:20,680 --> 00:24:21,680
I've got a match.

334
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:25,560
And how is that my problem?

335
00:24:25,560 --> 00:24:27,280
If you'd just let me do it, this would've been over.

336
00:24:27,280 --> 00:24:29,080
It's not my fault, you know.

337
00:24:30,440 --> 00:24:31,120
Hey,

338
00:24:31,480 --> 00:24:33,120
why don't you just go to hell?

339
00:24:48,800 --> 00:24:49,560
Well...

340
00:24:50,720 --> 00:24:52,720
I didn't know you had a match today.

341
00:25:05,880 --> 00:25:07,960
I'm having a meeting tonight.

342
00:25:08,440 --> 00:25:10,440
Secretary Pieng is coming to see me.

343
00:25:10,920 --> 00:25:11,880
Just hold on

344
00:25:21,120 --> 00:25:24,840
[I'm sorry, Yok.]

345
00:25:27,200 --> 00:25:28,080
[I'm sorry, Yok.]

346
00:25:41,560 --> 00:25:43,080
[I'm so sorry.]

347
00:25:48,120 --> 00:25:49,720
Why should I apologize to him?

348
00:25:50,400 --> 00:25:52,280
He's the one who started it.

349
00:26:05,800 --> 00:26:07,520
Yes, Director Pha-nu?

350
00:26:08,800 --> 00:26:09,720
Mr. Ing,

351
00:26:09,800 --> 00:26:11,520
your Mahasamut project,

352
00:26:11,680 --> 00:26:13,760
is selling like hotcakes, isn't it?

353
00:26:14,200 --> 00:26:15,440
Actually,

354
00:26:15,440 --> 00:26:17,320
I have to thank you

355
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:19,040
for helping me out.

356
00:26:19,520 --> 00:26:20,960
I called because there's something

357
00:26:21,320 --> 00:26:22,840
I want to talk to you about

358
00:26:23,200 --> 00:26:24,920
since we're so close.

359
00:26:25,120 --> 00:26:27,400
Please don't take offense at what I'm about to say.

360
00:26:27,960 --> 00:26:29,240
Let me be frank with you.

361
00:26:29,440 --> 00:26:31,960
I only did it 'cause I wanted what was best for you.

362
00:26:35,520 --> 00:26:37,440
You can be direct with me.

363
00:26:38,160 --> 00:26:40,520
Back when we were processing your project,

364
00:26:40,680 --> 00:26:42,480
there were four of us, me and my friends.

365
00:26:42,480 --> 00:26:45,160
You promised us one unit each.

366
00:26:45,400 --> 00:26:46,720
You remember that?

367
00:26:48,400 --> 00:26:49,160
Hold on a second.

368
00:26:51,200 --> 00:26:53,440
P'Pha-nu, what exactly happened?

369
00:26:53,440 --> 00:26:54,720
I'm not following.

370
00:26:55,040 --> 00:26:58,040
You kept your promise to me,

371
00:26:58,160 --> 00:26:59,760
but the other three...

372
00:26:59,800 --> 00:27:01,600
only received five million in cash.

373
00:27:01,800 --> 00:27:03,080
Those condo units...

374
00:27:03,280 --> 00:27:05,480
are worth over 20 million each, aren't they?

375
00:27:06,160 --> 00:27:07,040
Right now,

376
00:27:07,080 --> 00:27:09,440
they're getting pretty upset about this.

377
00:27:10,600 --> 00:27:12,560
P'Pha-nu... I mean, Director.

378
00:27:12,600 --> 00:27:14,800
I don't understand how this happened.

379
00:27:14,840 --> 00:27:16,560
May I look into it first?

380
00:27:16,800 --> 00:27:17,920
Please convey my apologies

381
00:27:17,960 --> 00:27:19,800
to all three of your friends, too.

382
00:27:20,160 --> 00:27:21,760
I'll get this sorted out as quickly as possible.

383
00:27:21,920 --> 00:27:24,600
Hearing you say that puts my mind at ease.

384
00:27:25,240 --> 00:27:26,400
Yes, thank you.

385
00:27:31,800 --> 00:27:32,520
Itt,

386
00:27:32,520 --> 00:27:33,880
I put you in charge of this project.

387
00:27:33,920 --> 00:27:35,560
Tell me what the hell happened.

388
00:27:37,960 --> 00:27:39,920
P'Ing, I didn't know anything about this.

389
00:27:39,920 --> 00:27:41,000
Oh, so you didn't know?

390
00:27:41,040 --> 00:27:42,640
Do you think that'll make it all go away?

391
00:27:42,760 --> 00:27:43,800
Let me ask you something.

392
00:27:43,800 --> 00:27:44,960
I trusted you with this.

393
00:27:44,960 --> 00:27:46,400
What the hell have you done?

394
00:27:48,400 --> 00:27:50,240
P'Ing, I didn't do it.

395
00:27:50,680 --> 00:27:51,600
You told me

396
00:27:51,640 --> 00:27:52,960
to have Pite help me, didn't you?

397
00:27:53,920 --> 00:27:56,160
After he handled Director Pha-nu's unit,

398
00:27:56,480 --> 00:27:59,200
he took the documents for the other three units with him.

399
00:27:59,240 --> 00:28:01,080
He said he could handle it on his own.

400
00:28:01,160 --> 00:28:03,200
Yeah, I told you to let him help,

401
00:28:03,200 --> 00:28:04,800
but I also told you to keep

402
00:28:04,800 --> 00:28:05,880
those sensitive documents safe.

403
00:28:06,560 --> 00:28:08,200
Why don't you ever listen to me?

404
00:28:08,240 --> 00:28:10,240
You're such a disappointment.

405
00:28:10,800 --> 00:28:12,720
I never should've let you intern here.

406
00:28:12,800 --> 00:28:14,520
I shouldn't have trusted you.

407
00:28:20,760 --> 00:28:21,360
P'Ing,

408
00:28:21,400 --> 00:28:23,320
I tried to stick with him the whole time.

409
00:28:24,360 --> 00:28:25,360
When he met the director and his friends,

410
00:28:25,360 --> 00:28:26,680
I was there, too.

411
00:28:26,760 --> 00:28:28,640
I thought he'd already completed the transfer.

412
00:28:28,680 --> 00:28:30,840
Yeah, he'd completed it.

413
00:28:31,040 --> 00:28:33,200
He gave those three people five million each.

414
00:28:33,240 --> 00:28:34,320
That's what he did.

415
00:28:34,320 --> 00:28:36,000
And then he pocketed my condo units for himself.

416
00:28:36,040 --> 00:28:37,240
He basically stole my money.

417
00:28:40,160 --> 00:28:41,280
Be honest with me.

418
00:28:42,560 --> 00:28:45,320
Did you and Pite plot to embezzle my money?

419
00:28:45,880 --> 00:28:48,520
P'Ing, I'm your brother.

420
00:28:48,520 --> 00:28:50,160
Why would I do something like that?

421
00:29:00,560 --> 00:29:01,440
Dammit.

422
00:29:01,760 --> 00:29:02,960
He turned off his phone on me.

423
00:29:07,440 --> 00:29:09,040
Hello, Ing?

424
00:29:10,160 --> 00:29:10,840
Auntie,

425
00:29:11,680 --> 00:29:12,600
where is Pite?

426
00:29:12,600 --> 00:29:14,080
I can't get ahold of him at all.

427
00:29:14,080 --> 00:29:15,400
Oh, Pite?

428
00:29:15,440 --> 00:29:17,880
He's visiting his uncle in Australia.

429
00:29:17,920 --> 00:29:19,680
He told me he won't be back for a year.

430
00:29:20,160 --> 00:29:21,040
Oh, is that so?

431
00:29:21,880 --> 00:29:23,840
Do you have a number where I can reach him?

432
00:29:23,880 --> 00:29:26,240
Yes, I do. Let me find it for you.

433
00:29:26,240 --> 00:29:27,720
Ing, don't you think...

434
00:29:27,760 --> 00:29:29,600
Pite looks way wealthier than before?

435
00:29:29,640 --> 00:29:31,600
He even bought his uncle

436
00:29:31,640 --> 00:29:33,240
a six-figure golf club set.

437
00:29:33,280 --> 00:29:35,080
Thank you so much, Ing,

438
00:29:35,120 --> 00:29:36,440
for mentoring him.

439
00:29:36,480 --> 00:29:37,360
I don't know

440
00:29:37,400 --> 00:29:39,080
what he'd do without you.

441
00:29:39,080 --> 00:29:41,880
I found the number. I'll send it over.

442
00:29:41,920 --> 00:29:42,600
Okay.

443
00:29:42,640 --> 00:29:43,920
Alright.

444
00:29:43,960 --> 00:29:44,840
Thank you.

445
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:47,600
That jerk already fled to Australia.

446
00:29:48,320 --> 00:29:49,000
Itt,

447
00:29:49,040 --> 00:29:50,800
absolutely no one can know about this.

448
00:29:51,160 --> 00:29:51,840
If I ever find out

449
00:29:51,880 --> 00:29:53,240
that you were in on this with him,

450
00:29:53,280 --> 00:29:54,960
you're never setting foot in my house again.

451
00:29:56,520 --> 00:29:57,680
Get lost.

452
00:30:01,040 --> 00:30:02,080
I said get lost.

453
00:30:02,120 --> 00:30:03,600
What the hell are you crying for?

454
00:30:05,360 --> 00:30:07,800
Dammit, not a single one of you can do anything right.

455
00:30:16,000 --> 00:30:16,800
[Jelly (Junior)]

456
00:30:16,800 --> 00:30:18,920
[I'm all ready now.]

457
00:30:18,920 --> 00:30:21,640
[Are you free tonight, Mr. Ing?]

458
00:30:26,120 --> 00:30:26,640
[Score Sheet]

459
00:30:30,560 --> 00:30:31,960
I fought tooth and nail

460
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:33,440
to get this tryout match back for you.

461
00:30:34,360 --> 00:30:36,040
You'd better make all my effort worth it.

462
00:30:37,400 --> 00:30:38,800
I won't let you down.

463
00:30:53,640 --> 00:30:54,720
It's good you came.

464
00:30:55,960 --> 00:30:57,640
I've had nothing but headaches lately.

465
00:31:02,960 --> 00:31:03,760
Come here.

466
00:31:19,600 --> 00:31:20,640
Whoa...

467
00:31:21,400 --> 00:31:23,200
You've made some progress, I see.

468
00:31:36,160 --> 00:31:36,800
I'm...

469
00:31:36,840 --> 00:31:38,320
I'm so sorry, Mr. Ing.

470
00:31:38,440 --> 00:31:40,640
It's just that... I don't have any experience.

471
00:31:45,160 --> 00:31:46,440
That part of yours...

472
00:31:47,400 --> 00:31:48,600
Is it alright?

473
00:31:49,440 --> 00:31:50,760
Stop staring down there.

474
00:31:52,440 --> 00:31:53,760
Whatever.

475
00:31:54,960 --> 00:31:56,080
Hand me a cigarette.

476
00:32:01,800 --> 00:32:02,600
Here you go.

477
00:32:04,960 --> 00:32:05,800
Where's the lighter?

478
00:32:06,440 --> 00:32:07,440
Isn't it right there?

479
00:32:08,440 --> 00:32:09,960
I'll buy one for you.

480
00:32:15,240 --> 00:32:16,040
What is it?

481
00:32:21,840 --> 00:32:23,160
If you can,

482
00:32:24,960 --> 00:32:26,440
please cut down on smoking.

483
00:32:27,640 --> 00:32:29,160
It's bad for your health.

484
00:32:39,040 --> 00:32:40,040
You're right.

485
00:32:41,640 --> 00:32:43,040
I guess I can cut down a little.

486
00:32:46,760 --> 00:32:47,760
Come sit here.

487
00:33:10,560 --> 00:33:12,160
You're a fast learner.

488
00:33:13,840 --> 00:33:17,120
I'll be looking forward to your progress next time.

489
00:33:19,920 --> 00:33:22,560
Thank you, Mr. Ing.

490
00:33:27,440 --> 00:33:28,160
Fight.

491
00:33:29,880 --> 00:33:30,960
Keep eye contact, kid.

492
00:33:34,240 --> 00:33:35,640
-Go. -Go, go, go.

493
00:33:36,240 --> 00:33:37,080
Come on.

494
00:33:38,000 --> 00:33:39,000
Start swinging.

495
00:33:39,040 --> 00:33:40,080
Yeah, that's it.

496
00:33:43,080 --> 00:33:44,280
I seriously don't like P'Ing.

497
00:33:44,280 --> 00:33:45,280
-I actually like... -That's enough.

498
00:33:45,320 --> 00:33:47,320
That face of yours doesn't just belong to you.

499
00:33:47,320 --> 00:33:49,120
It carries the name of the Sukonsiri family.

500
00:33:49,160 --> 00:33:50,720
If I don't get to be inside you in this life,

501
00:33:50,760 --> 00:33:51,960
don't ever call me Ing again.

502
00:33:54,880 --> 00:33:55,840
Now we're even.

503
00:33:55,880 --> 00:33:56,880
You won't be able to get me out of your head.

504
00:33:56,880 --> 00:33:58,080
Why don't you just go to hell?

505
00:34:04,240 --> 00:34:05,000
Go.

506
00:34:08,560 --> 00:34:10,159
-Hey. -Great. That's good.

507
00:34:13,280 --> 00:34:14,159
Go.

508
00:35:12,320 --> 00:35:13,560
Yes, P'Pha-nu.

509
00:35:13,600 --> 00:35:16,280
I've completed the transfer of three condo units

510
00:35:16,320 --> 00:35:17,960
in my new project.

511
00:35:19,520 --> 00:35:20,280
Yes.

512
00:35:20,560 --> 00:35:22,920
I'm really sorry for all the trouble this caused.

513
00:35:23,960 --> 00:35:26,360
Yes, thank you.

514
00:35:28,960 --> 00:35:30,480
Pite, you jerk.

515
00:35:33,480 --> 00:35:34,280
Come in.

516
00:35:51,120 --> 00:35:52,200
Regarding the agricultural development project

517
00:35:52,240 --> 00:35:53,640
you mentioned last time,

518
00:35:54,120 --> 00:35:56,560
P'Phet said the council was pleased with the proposal.

519
00:35:56,960 --> 00:35:58,360
He wants you to take the project manager

520
00:35:58,360 --> 00:35:59,600
on a site visit as well.

521
00:36:07,040 --> 00:36:08,400
We'll go next month.

522
00:36:12,160 --> 00:36:12,960
Yes, sir.

523
00:36:15,680 --> 00:36:16,480
By the way...

524
00:36:18,640 --> 00:36:20,400
how long has it been since you last came here?

525
00:36:21,960 --> 00:36:22,880
I don't remember.

526
00:36:23,280 --> 00:36:24,160
Why haven't you been coming in?

527
00:36:24,600 --> 00:36:25,600
Been busy with my studies.

528
00:36:29,680 --> 00:36:30,600
And...

529
00:36:34,960 --> 00:36:35,960
The boxing situation?

530
00:36:42,680 --> 00:36:43,880
It's been taken care of.

531
00:36:48,680 --> 00:36:49,600
Also...

532
00:36:54,800 --> 00:36:56,480
Try to come here more often

533
00:36:57,960 --> 00:36:59,320
because you're currently in possession

534
00:36:59,360 --> 00:37:00,560
of some important documents.

535
00:37:02,600 --> 00:37:03,760
If you don't want to do this anymore, say it.

536
00:37:04,800 --> 00:37:05,880
I'll find someone else to handle it.

537
00:37:08,920 --> 00:37:11,320
I'll come into the office at least once a week.

538
00:37:13,640 --> 00:37:14,400
But...

539
00:37:14,520 --> 00:37:15,640
I know.

540
00:37:22,160 --> 00:37:23,800
Arguing about it won't change anything.

541
00:37:27,280 --> 00:37:28,280
So...

542
00:37:29,880 --> 00:37:31,280
are you coming to Pattaya with me?

543
00:37:32,960 --> 00:37:33,680
Yes.

544
00:37:37,680 --> 00:37:39,280
Let's go grab some dinner tonight, then.

545
00:37:39,680 --> 00:37:40,560
I have other plans.

546
00:37:41,480 --> 00:37:42,800
It's just a meal.

547
00:37:43,280 --> 00:37:45,080
You have to eat dinner anyway, don't you?

548
00:37:50,480 --> 00:37:51,960
Fine, have it your way.

549
00:37:52,800 --> 00:37:53,880
Get back to work, then.

550
00:37:59,560 --> 00:38:01,960
Fine, don't eat then.

551
00:38:02,080 --> 00:38:03,480
You think I'm gonna beg you?

552
00:38:09,600 --> 00:38:11,200
Congratulations, Mr. Leo.

553
00:38:11,200 --> 00:38:12,120
Thanks, Ray.

554
00:38:12,120 --> 00:38:13,320
You actually made it.

555
00:38:13,480 --> 00:38:14,440
The place looks beautiful.

556
00:38:14,480 --> 00:38:15,480
-The vibe is amazing. -I know, right?

557
00:38:16,040 --> 00:38:16,920
Please support it.

558
00:38:16,960 --> 00:38:17,840
Will do.

559
00:38:18,320 --> 00:38:19,920
I'll head inside first, then.

560
00:38:19,920 --> 00:38:20,520
Sure thing.

561
00:38:20,560 --> 00:38:21,600
Take some photos for the review.

562
00:38:21,600 --> 00:38:22,440
You got it.

563
00:38:23,720 --> 00:38:26,240
-Hey. -What's up?

564
00:38:27,000 --> 00:38:28,320
Looking sharp today.

565
00:38:28,360 --> 00:38:30,560
Well, it's my grand opening today.

566
00:38:30,560 --> 00:38:33,080
You expect me to look like a kicked puppy?

567
00:38:33,520 --> 00:38:34,200
Come on.

568
00:38:34,800 --> 00:38:37,000
Lots of familiar faces here today.

569
00:38:37,440 --> 00:38:38,360
You bet.

570
00:38:38,360 --> 00:38:40,360
Most of them are friends coming to show support.

571
00:38:40,520 --> 00:38:41,640
It's just Win

572
00:38:41,680 --> 00:38:43,440
who's off taking his sweetheart on a trip abroad.

573
00:38:43,440 --> 00:38:45,280
When he gets back, let me know.

574
00:38:45,480 --> 00:38:47,000
I really want to see what his partner looks like.

575
00:38:47,040 --> 00:38:48,360
So do I.

576
00:38:49,800 --> 00:38:52,720
Wait, who's this? A new flame?

577
00:38:52,800 --> 00:38:55,000
He's quite the looker.

578
00:38:55,520 --> 00:38:56,920
This is Leo.

579
00:38:58,800 --> 00:39:00,400
Hello, Mr. Leo.

580
00:39:00,440 --> 00:39:01,960
Come on, there's no need for that.

581
00:39:02,120 --> 00:39:04,040
You can just call me P'Leo.

582
00:39:04,600 --> 00:39:05,160
Okay.

583
00:39:05,200 --> 00:39:06,280
Excuse me, Mit.

584
00:39:06,400 --> 00:39:08,680
Please look after these two guests.

585
00:39:08,720 --> 00:39:10,960
I'd like a VIP room for Mr. Ing here.

586
00:39:10,960 --> 00:39:12,080
Give him a private room.

587
00:39:12,520 --> 00:39:13,600
Please take good care of them.

588
00:39:14,440 --> 00:39:16,160
Just try not to wreck my room.

589
00:39:18,480 --> 00:39:19,640
I can't make any promises.

590
00:39:19,640 --> 00:39:21,760
If we happen to do so, sorry, buddy.

591
00:39:21,760 --> 00:39:23,360
I knew it.

592
00:39:23,360 --> 00:39:24,880
-Thanks, man. -See you.

593
00:39:24,880 --> 00:39:25,600
Yeah.

594
00:39:27,720 --> 00:39:28,640
Next time,

595
00:39:28,640 --> 00:39:29,920
I'll buy you a watch.

596
00:39:33,320 --> 00:39:34,720
Thank you, P'Ing.

597
00:39:35,240 --> 00:39:36,120
It's nothing.

598
00:39:36,720 --> 00:39:37,920
You deserve it.

599
00:39:57,840 --> 00:39:58,840
You should leave.

600
00:39:59,720 --> 00:40:01,520
Come on, go home. It's nothing.

601
00:40:01,840 --> 00:40:02,920
Go on.

602
00:40:06,400 --> 00:40:07,200
Yok.

603
00:40:08,400 --> 00:40:09,200
Hey.

604
00:40:10,920 --> 00:40:11,840
Yok.

605
00:40:13,120 --> 00:40:13,920
Hey.

606
00:40:19,640 --> 00:40:20,400
Yok.

607
00:40:20,720 --> 00:40:22,280
Yok, talk to me right now.

608
00:40:22,360 --> 00:40:23,200
Let go of me.

609
00:40:25,880 --> 00:40:28,880
Oh, so this was your other plan?

610
00:40:29,680 --> 00:40:30,360
Huh?

611
00:40:31,960 --> 00:40:33,880
P'Ing, what exactly do you want?

612
00:40:34,320 --> 00:40:36,320
Didn't you say there's no point in us arguing?

613
00:40:36,640 --> 00:40:38,040
Then why are you making such a scene?

614
00:40:39,840 --> 00:40:40,640
Oh...

615
00:40:45,360 --> 00:40:46,280
Are you jealous?

616
00:40:50,600 --> 00:40:51,360
Look.

617
00:40:53,880 --> 00:40:55,760
If you're jealous, just be honest and say it.

618
00:40:57,840 --> 00:40:58,920
It's nothing.

619
00:41:00,320 --> 00:41:01,520
I can explain, you know.

620
00:41:06,320 --> 00:41:07,120
Jealous?

621
00:41:07,640 --> 00:41:08,720
You're so full of yourself.

622
00:41:09,040 --> 00:41:10,400
You'll just sleep with anyone,

623
00:41:10,480 --> 00:41:12,080
and it disgusts me.

624
00:41:12,120 --> 00:41:13,200
What did you just say?

625
00:41:13,920 --> 00:41:15,400
You're disgusting.

626
00:41:16,320 --> 00:41:18,640
You literally took me first.

627
00:41:19,640 --> 00:41:20,720
You took me, didn't you?

628
00:41:25,520 --> 00:41:26,840
You punched me, huh?

629
00:41:26,840 --> 00:41:27,640
You punched me?

630
00:41:31,120 --> 00:41:32,120
You little jerk.

631
00:41:32,920 --> 00:41:34,400
You kicked me?

632
00:41:40,080 --> 00:41:40,960
Shoot.

633
00:41:42,400 --> 00:41:44,920
Why didn't you warn me first?

634
00:41:46,480 --> 00:41:48,360
Oh, it's already past midnight, Leo.

635
00:41:49,320 --> 00:41:51,400
My Cinderella time is up.

636
00:41:51,440 --> 00:41:52,480
I'm leaving.

637
00:41:57,120 --> 00:41:58,600
I'll take my leave.

638
00:42:03,360 --> 00:42:04,240
I'm here to apologize.

639
00:42:05,960 --> 00:42:06,840
Apologize?

640
00:42:06,880 --> 00:42:08,040
You're not backing out

641
00:42:09,080 --> 00:42:10,560
just because you fell for my brother, are you?

642
00:42:11,200 --> 00:42:11,920
P'Ing,

643
00:42:12,440 --> 00:42:13,680
we need to sort this out first.

644
00:42:15,400 --> 00:42:17,040
We're in public, you know.

645
00:42:21,520 --> 00:42:22,360
Yok.

646
00:42:23,480 --> 00:42:25,000
You said we'd watch the sunrise together, didn't you?

647
00:42:32,040 --> 00:42:33,080
P'Ing...
